                "questionHindi": "क्या मैं मदुरै, तमिलनाडु या उत्तर भारत से इस बजट अंडमान पैकेज की बुकिंग कर सकता हूँ?",
                "answer": "Yes. Logaa Holidays, Madurai can coordinate the Budget Andaman Package for travellers from Madurai, Chennai and other South Indian cities, as well as customers from North India. The land-tour pickup remains Port Blair Airport unless a different arrangement is confirmed in the final quotation.",
